  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Important note:\n- This package replaces GrapeCity.Documents.Pdf, and provides the same functionality, ensures future enhancements, and is backwards compatible with GrapeCity.Documents.Pdf. Existing subscriptions will continue to apply to this new package.\n\n# Changes since version 8.1.1:\n\n## Fixed\n- Exception may be thrown when calling the GcPdfGraphics.MeasureString() method with certain fonts. (DOC-6910)\n- The GcPdfDocument.GetText() method may hang if some pages of the PDF contain errors. (DOC-6912)\n\n## Added\n- GrapeCity.Documents.Pdf.TextMap.TextRenderingAttrs class: represents a set of attributes used to control how text is rendered. (DOC-6896)\n- Page.SetTextRenderingAttrs(FindTextParams, TextRenderingAttrs) method: searches for a specified text on the current page and sets its rendering attributes. (DOC-6896)\n- Page.SetTextRenderingAttrs() method overloads: set the rendering attributes for a specified text fragment on the current page. (DOC-6896)",
